ds text-gray-700">Essai compris, et retouches avant la cérémonie.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-2"><p class="max-w-full whitespace-pre-line break-words text-right font-semibold text-indigo-900 text-lg">À partir de 150 €</p></div></div></li><li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-4"><h3 class="break-words text-start font-bold text-indigo-900 text-lg">Maquillage invitée</h3><div class="flex flex-col gap-3"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1 border-gray-300 border-l pl-4"><p class="break-words text-gray-700">Pour la famille et les témoins.</p></div><div class="flex flex-col items-end gap-2"><p class="max-w-full whitespace-pre-line break-words text-right font-semibold text-indigo-900 text-lg">45 €</p></div></div></li></ul></div></section></div><div class="order-9 w-full min-w-0 md:order-none"><section class="reveal w-full min-w-0 rounded border border-gray-300 bg-white"><details open="" class="group"><summary class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 px-6 pt-6 pb-6 group-open:pb-4 sm:px-8 sm:pt-8 md:cursor-default [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2"><h2 class="font-bold text-gray-700 text-xl">Expériences professionnelles</h2><svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-gray-700 transition-transform group-open:rotate-90 md:hidden"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="m8.61 5.89 5.79 5.79c.08.08.29.21.26.35-.02.12-2.81 2.84-3.19 3.21l-2.18 2.19c-.24.23-.65.54-.8.83-.18.36.15.81.54.8q.17-.01.3-.11c.35-.28.66-.65.97-.97l2.05-2.04 2.78-2.78c.3-.31 1.32-.99.76-1.55l-3.52-3.52-1.56-1.56-.85-.86c-.29-.28-.68-.9-1.16-.68a.6.6 0 0 0-.32.34c-.09.21-.01.4.13.56"></path></svg></summary><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-4 px-6 pb-6 sm:px-8 sm:pb-8"><ul class="flex flex-col gap-5"><li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="break-words font-semibold text-gray-700">Studio fictif du maquillage</p><p class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-4 text-gray-600 text-sm italic"><span class="break-words">Maquilleuse</span><span>janvier 2017 - décembre 2020</span></p><p class="break-words text-gray-600 text-sm italic">à Annecy</p><p class="break-words text-gray-500 text-sm italic">Maquillage des mariées et des invitées, essais en studio.</p></li><li class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-1"><p class="break-words font-semibold text-gray-700">À son compte</p><p class="flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-x-4 text-gray-600 text-sm italic"><span class="break-words">Maquilleuse indépendante</span><span>janvier 2021 - aujourd’hui</span></p><p class="break-words text-gray-600 text-sm italic">à Annecy</p></li></ul></div></details></section></div></div></div></div><div class="sticky bottom-0 z-20 flex items-center gap-4 border-gray-300 border-t bg-white px-4 py-3 shadow-[0_-4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] md:hidden justify-between"><p class="shrink-0 font-semibold text-gray-800">À partir de 45 €</p><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" class="inline-flex min-h-12 max-w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-indigo-700 px-6 py-2 text-center [overflow-wrap:anywhere] font-semibold text-base text-white hover:bg-indigo-800 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-indigo-600 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 min-w-0">Contacter Manon</button></div></main>